---
import { url } from '../utils/url';
---

<div class="mk-app-mock">
  <div class="mk-app-mock-titlebar">
    <div class="mk-app-mock-tl">
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mk-app-mock-body">
    <aside class="mk-app-mock-side">
      <div class="mk-app-mock-side-head">
        <img src={url('favicon-app.svg')} alt="" width="18" height="18" />
        <span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px;">launch-notes</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-side-row folder">campaigns</div>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-side-row" style="padding-left: 18px;"><span class="dot"></span>Q4 launch brief</div>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-side-row active" style="padding-left: 18px;"><span class="dot"></span>Friday standup notes</div>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-side-row" style="padding-left: 18px;"><span class="dot"></span>hero-shot.png</div>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-side-row folder">drafts</div>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-side-row" style="padding-left: 18px;"><span class="dot"></span>Pricing rewrite</div>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-side-row"><span class="dot"></span>README</div>
    </aside>
    <main class="mk-app-mock-main">
      <h1 class="mk-app-mock-title">Friday standup notes</h1>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-body-text">
        <p>Quick read-through of where each workstream landed this week. Nothing on fire. We're moving the launch back one week so design can finish the email sequence.</p>
        <h3>What shipped</h3>
        <p>Pricing page copy v2. Hero illustration round 3 (we picked B). Onboarding email 1 of 4.</p>
        <h3>What's next</h3>
        <p>Everyone has their lane. The only blocker is whether legal signs off on the comparison table by Tuesday.</p>
      </div>
    </main>
    <aside class="mk-app-mock-chat">
      <div class="mk-app-mock-chat-head">Launch brief</div>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-chat-msg user">Summarize @standup.md in 3 lines</div>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-chat-msg">Launch slips one week. Pricing v2 shipped, FAQ block still in <code>drafts/</code>. Only blocker is legal sign-off.</div>
      <div class="mk-app-mock-chat-input">Ask… (@ files, / skills)</div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>
